# Aspire Leaders Program
<br>
Selected as one of 9,362 finalists from 45,228 students in Cohort 4 (2025) of the Aspire Leaders Program by the Aspire Institute, completing a two-module program focused on leadership, professional development, problem-solving, AI, trust, and community impact. The program included resources co-created with Harvard Business School and an Aspire Horizons course delivered by Harvard faculty.
